 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->519106924,ExpressionUUID->"2b7815b9-63c5-7b4b-b52e-f7b880e922ba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In the curried forms, a positive integer ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["filling", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "6979a322-a0ad-f14c-9c7e-c809db12522e"],
 " selects that many lowest-energy bands. A real ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["filling", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "7c898241-b25c-4241-a868-433796aeee13"],
 " selects energies at or below the Fermi energy; use ",
 Cell[BoxData["0."], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "e9321dc1-1d18-c34a-8f2f-07ea286d7a93"],
 " to specify zero Fermi energy."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1471248794,ExpressionUUID->"6880bd6b-530e-1940-83dd-d52cb52c1921"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The default derivative directions are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "60d5394b-81eb-c244-b6c8-e2a1b5cdd1e0"],
 ". A supplied observable matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c7053437-37a8-c649-9c68-337d5202d1b5"],
 " produces the symmetrized current shown below; the special value ",
 Cell[BoxData["1"], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "45b7dbe4-94ad-1142-aa58-8d0b545fc28b"],
 " selects the ordinary derivative."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->894119330,ExpressionUUID->"4ea6af61-2025-7d4b-bc06-acc6063d7dae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The curried forms return ",
 Cell[BoxData["0."], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "80e0c030-73fe-cf47-ba3f-82b3bab82960"],
 " for an empty or completely occupied spectrum."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->142705011,ExpressionUUID->"360a10f7-83bd-3745-9563-84574df5810f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In the uncurried form, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "516862c7-99b2-e741-903f-cbadcf15748b"],
 " must be a two-component numeric vector. Exact coordinates such as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "1ef0a17b-ca8c-3949-888a-2892d25099e9"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox[
     StyleBox["\[Pi]", "TI"], "2"], ",", "0"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c6efc6a3-a592-7e41-9340-f9552540f641"],
 " are accepted, as are approximate coordinates. This form estimates \
two-dimensional derivatives using a backward-difference step of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    FractionBox["1", 
     SuperscriptBox["10", "7"]],
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "5424e86b-eb3b-1f4e-9244-4f61f162b27d"],
 ". Degeneracies across the filling can make the Kubo denominator singular."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1944383923,ExpressionUUID->"86cb4b5a-192f-6345-946b-f9e0c721d14e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Eigensystem"]], "paclet:ref/Eigensystem"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "8cfb1ee8-2d6e-1a44-bbc5-72168d592cbd"],
 " are accepted, with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["Method"]], "paclet:ref/Method"},
    "RefLink",
    BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}], "\[Rule]", "\"\<Direct\>\""}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "e926464d-bc81-9c4b-bd65-a0c97b539506"],
 " supplied internally."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->426154102,ExpressionUUID->"5ab452d1-1631-8e42-ac59-b13be409dbe4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With occupied states indexed by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox["n",
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "a9f3f252-eb47-8546-951c-04933d268b51"],
 " and unoccupied states by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox["m",
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "8ef0418c-b5a8-864c-be82-e143d13cf6fb"],
 ", the implemented convention is",
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ",", "\[Beta]"}], "}"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Im", "(", 
       RowBox[{
        UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
         RowBox[{"n", "=", "1"}], 
         SubscriptBox["N", "occ"]], 
        RowBox[{
         UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
          RowBox[{"m", "=", 
           RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox["N", "occ"], "+", "1"}]}], 
          SubscriptBox["N", "bands"]], 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["j", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ",", "m", ",", "n"}], "}"}]], " ", 
           SubscriptBox["v", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"\[Beta]", ",", "n", ",", "m"}], "}"}]]}], 
          SuperscriptBox[
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             SubscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "m"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "n"]}], ")"}], "2"]]}]}], ")"}]}]}],
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FontSize->14,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "50ef2724-e0f4-c448-8749-bcd8e1950c78"]
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1554334274,ExpressionUUID->"22dc3872-4c10-af4d-a854-0fd04ef78ae9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The observable-current insertion is",
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["j", "\[Alpha]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Q", ".", 
         SubscriptBox["v", "\[Alpha]"]}], "+", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["v", "\[Alpha]"], ".", "Q"}]}], ")"}]}]}],
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FontSize->14,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "efe6c1af-7ab7-be4b-aa8a-b99b7a60bb8d"]
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1808814977,ExpressionUUID->"bc8817fe-fd64-2b47-a219-eb446b9513a6"]
}, Closed]],

